pack.name=Wind Glider – Resources
pack.description=Short hop: press Jump again within 0.4s to open. Long fall: after 0.8s press Jump once to open. Press Jump again to close. After a wall impact, reopen only after landing. An open glider gains lift over fire, lit campfires and exposed lava. Up to 4 heat zones, then a 10s pause.
windglider.guide.gliding.title=Gliding
windglider.guide.gliding.body=Hold the Wind Glider in your hand. Press Jump again right after jumping. If you have been falling for longer, one press in the air is enough.
windglider.guide.updraft.title=Updraft
windglider.guide.updraft.body=Fly over hot sources to gain height again.
